Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Isisefu entsha: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault fihla: message isitshixo: key.
>> decrypted := vault tyhila: encrypted isitshixo: key.

Imveliso 
bhala: ['Message:'], umgca-omtsha
bhala: message, umgca-omtsha
